{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And your father has deceived me and changed my wages</b> — This was true, and if so, Scripture did not recount it at the outset. So too he says to him, \"And you have changed my wages ten times\" (Genesis 31:41). And similar cases occur in many places in the Torah, and earlier in this very pericah Scripture did not recount that Leah gave the mandrakes to Rachel."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:37:28.511332702Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}